<title>UK: Banco Santander unit sets $150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Banco Santander unit sets $150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANTANDER FINANCIAL ISSUANCES LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANCO SANTANDER SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	SPREAD     30 BP     MATURITY	 OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.93     FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.93</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
